{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"1","result":{"kind":"task","id":"6a89fc59-c87b-4991-b697-ab1111e35d08","artifacts":[{"artifactId":"bc8db502-d752-40a6-b1eb-6f48c2c0ab9d","parts":[{"kind":"text","text":"### PromQL Query Executed\n\nTo measure the restart count delta over the last 30 minutes, the following query was executed:\n\n```promql\nkube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"demo-broken\"} - (kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"demo-broken\"} offset 30m)\n```\n\nAnd aggregated by container:\n\n```promql\nsum by (container) (kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"demo-broken\"} - (kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"demo-broken\"} offset 30m))\n```\n\n---\n\n### Raw Numbers Returned\n\n**Time Range:** Last 30 minutes (~`09:02 UTC` to `09:32 UTC` on October 7, 2026)  \n**Unit:** restarts (count)\n\n| Container | Pod | Restarts at `T-30m` | Restarts at `Now` | Net Restarts in Last 30m |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `worker` | `worker-59c46dcdc4-mtt5x` | 37 | 43 | **6** |\n| `cache` | `cache-7d9bbbd4cc-kr5sx` | 37 | 43 | **6** |\n| `web` | `web-894868994-c6g99` | 0 | 0 | **0** |\n| `web` | `web-894868994-qm2bv` | 0 | 0 | **0** |\n| `api` | `api-74dd9997fd-cfx82` | 0 | 0 | **0** |\n\n---\n\n### Interpretation\n\n- The containers **`worker`** (pod `worker-59c46dcdc4-mtt5x`) and **`cache`** (pod `cache-7d9bbbd4cc-kr5sx`) tied for restarting the most in the last 30 minutes.\n- Each restarted **6 times** over the 30-minute window (both going from 37 to 43 cumulative restarts, averaging roughly one restart every ~5 minutes due to `CrashLoopBackOff` backoff delay).\n- No other containers in the `demo-broken` namespace restarted during this window."}]}],"contextId":"9229290d-1259-4152-8e9b-bfcc84a525f2","history":[{"kind":"message","messageId":"s07-1791365501","contextId":"9229290d-1259-4152-8e9b-bfcc84a525f2","parts":[{"kind":"text","text":"Which containers in namespace demo-broken restarted most in the last 30 m