9:32 UTC` on October 7, 2026)  \n**Unit:** restarts (count)\n\n| Container | Pod | Restarts at `T-30m` | Restarts at `Now` | Net Restarts in Last 30m |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `worker` | `worker-59c46dcdc4-mtt5x` | 37 | 43 | **6** |\n| `cache` | `cache-7d9bbbd4cc-kr5sx` | 37 | 43 | **6** |\n| `web` | `web-894868994-c6g99` | 0 | 0 | **0** |\n| `web` | `web-894868994-qm2bv` | 0 | 0 | **0** |\n| `api` | `api-74dd9997fd-cfx82` | 0 | 0 | **0** |\n\n---\n\n### Interpretation\n\n- The containers **`worker`** (pod `worker-59c46dcdc4-mtt5x`) and **`cache`** (pod `cache-7d9bbbd4cc-kr5sx`) tied for restarting the most in the last 30 minutes.\n- Each restarted **6 times** over the 30-minute window (both going from 37 to 43 cumulative restarts, averaging roughly one restart every ~5 minutes due to `CrashLoopBackOff` backoff delay).\n- No other containers in the `demo-broken` namespace restarted during this window."}],"role":"agent"}],"metadata":{"kagent_adk_partial":null,"kagent_app_name":"kagent__NS__observability_analyst","kagent_author":"observability_analyst","kagent_invocation_id":"e-fe5a76c5-898e-40b6-a89c-0cab788d6abe","kagent_session_id":"9229290d-1259-4152-8e9b-bfcc84a525f2","kagent_usage_metadata":{"candidatesTokenCount":562,"promptTokenCount":6307,"totalTokenCount":6869},"kagent_user_id":"admin@kagent.dev"},"status":{"state":"completed","timestamp":"2026-10-07T09:32:11.142683Z"}}}
